WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the GWTH.ai homepage explainer. Cue windows match the assembled
draft voiceover (David's cloned voice). British English, no em dashes on screen.
If the final voiceover is re-recorded, re-time these cues to the new audio.

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.700
AI is changing how the world works.
Most people are watching it happen. You do not have to.

2
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:17.400
GWTH is a three month applied AI course for adults in the UK.
It starts in plain English, with no coding and no jargon to wade through first.

3
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:25.700
In about five hours a week, you learn to do real things with AI.
Build small apps. Automate the busywork.

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.700
Research in minutes, not hours.
And make sense of your own data, all in plain language.

5
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:43.700
Most AI courses hand you slides and a certificate.
GWTH is built the other way round. Every lesson and project leaves real work behind, proof you can actually show.

6
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:52.000
Because the truth is simpler than it sounds.
If you can describe what you want, you can begin to build it.

7
00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:03.900
We are opening GWTH to a small group of hand picked beta learners.
Start free, with real labs and no card. Join when the work is worth it. GWTH.ai
